  "bodyHash": "740fcf3ebb9446d2",
  "content": "你好世界<p><strong>本模组需要<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/hammer-lib\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://curseforge.zeith.org/api/v2/logo?id=247401\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" />&nbsp;HammerLib</strong></a>。</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><b>Solar Flux Reborn 新增可產生 FE 或 RF 的面板。</b></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><img src=\"https://cf.way2muchnoise.eu/versions/246974_all.svg\" width=\"456\" height=\"18\" /></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>CORE 模組提供 8 種不同等級的面板（完全可自訂！）</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>還允許您使用自訂紋理、名稱及 FE 速率建立<span style=\"color: #800000;\">自訂面板</span>！請參閱 /.minecraft/config/solarflux/custom_panels.js 或觀看教學影片！</strong></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><b>請注意，本模組亦支援以下模組：</b></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/projects/223565\"><b><img src=\"https://curseforge.zeith.org/api/v2/logo?id=223565\" alt=\"\" width=\"96\" height=\"32\" />Draconic Evolution</b></a></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/projects/223628\"><b><img src=\"https://curseforge.zeith.org/api/v2/logo?id=223628\" alt=\"\" width=\"49\" height=\"32\" />&nbsp;Thaumcraft</b></a></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/projects/261348\"><b><img src=\"https://curseforge.zeith.org/api/v2/logo?id=261348\" alt=\"\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" />&nbsp;Avaritia </b></a></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/projects/227639\"><b><img src=\"https://curseforge.zeith.org/api/v2/logo?id=227639\" alt=\"\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" />&nbsp;The Twilight Forest</b></a></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/ae2\"><b><img src=\"https://curseforge.zeith.org/api/v2/logo?id=223794\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" /> Applied Energistics 2</b></a></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/projects/261061\"><b><img src=\"https://curseforge.zeith.org/api/v2/logo?id=261061\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" /> Black Hole Storage </b></a></span></li>\n  <li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/project/yPlaLxD1\"><b><img src=\"https://curseforge.zeith.org/api/v2/logo?id=237664\" alt=\"\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" /> Iron Furnaces</b></a></span></li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 18px; color: #ff0000;\">版本 1.14.4 不適用於 Java 11。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 18px; color: #ff0000;\">版本 1.16.5 不適用於 Java 17。</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h3><span style=\"font-size: 36px;\"><strong>內容：</strong></span></h3>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><strong>方塊：</strong></span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://assets.zeith.org/assets/solarflux/sp_1.png\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" />&nbsp;太陽能面板 I</p>\n<ul>\n<li>生成：1 FE/每秒</li>\n<li傳輸：8 FE/每秒</li>\n<li>容量：25,000 FE</li>\n</ul>\n<p><img src=\"https://assets.zeith.org/assets/solarflux/sp_2.png\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" />&nbsp;太陽能面板 II</p>\n<ul>\n<li>生成：8 FE/每秒</li>\n<li>傳輸：64 FE/每秒</li>\n<li>容量：125,000 FE</li>\n</ul>\n<p><img src=\"https://assets.zeith.org/assets/solarflux/sp_3.png\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" />&nbsp;太陽能面板 III</p>\n<ul>\n<li>生成：32 FE/每秒</li>\n<li>傳輸：256 FE/每秒</li>\n<li>容量：425,000 FE</li>\n</ul>\n<p><img src=\"https://assets.zeith.org/assets/solarflux/sp_4.png\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" />&nbsp;太陽能面板 IV</p>\n<ul>\n<li>生成：128 FE/每秒</li>\n<li>傳輸：1,024 FE/每秒</li>\n<li>容量：2,000,000 FE</li>\n</ul>\n<p><img src=\"https://assets.zeith.org/assets/solarflux/sp_5.png\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" />&nbsp;太陽能面板 V</p>\n<ul>\n<li>生成：512 FE/每秒</li>\n<li>傳輸：4,096 FE/每秒</li>\n<li>容量：8,000,000 FE</li>\n</ul>\n<p><img src=\"https://assets.zeith.org/assets/solarflux/sp_6.png\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" />&nbsp;太陽能面板 VI</p>\n<ul>\n<li>生成：2,048 FE/每秒</li>\n<li>傳輸：16,384 FE/每秒</li>\n<li>容量：32,000,000 FE</li>\n</ul>\n<p><img src=\"https://assets.zeith.org/assets/solarflux/sp_7.png\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" />&nbsp;太陽能面板 VII</p>\n<ul>\n<li>生成：8,192 FE/每秒</li>\n<li>傳輸：64,000 FE/每秒</li>\n<li>容量：64,000,000 FE</li>\n</ul>\n<p><img src=\"https://assets.zeith.org/assets/solarflux/sp_8.png\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" />&nbsp;太陽能面板 VIII</p>\n<ul>\n<li>生成：32,768 FE/每秒</li>\n<li>傳輸：256,000 FE/每秒</li>\n<li>容量：128,000,000 FE</li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/projects/223565\"><img src=\"https://curseforge.zeith.org/api/v2/logo?id=223565\" alt=\"\" width=\"96\" height=\"32\" /> Draconic Evolution</a> 面板：</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://assets.zeith.org/assets/solarflux/sp_de.wyvern.png\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" />&nbsp;野獸太陽能面板</p>\n<ul>\n<li>生成：65,536 FE/每秒</li>\n<li>傳輸：512,000 FE/每秒</li>\n<li>容量：256,000,000 FE</li>\n</ul>\n<p><img src=\"https://assets.zeith.org/assets/solarflux/sp_de.draconic.png\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" />&nbsp;龍族太陽能面板</p>\n<ul>\n<li>生成：131,072 FE/每秒</li>\n<li>傳輸：1,024,000 FE/每秒</li>\n<li>容量：512,000,000 FE</li>\n</ul>\n<p><img src=\"https://assets.zeith.org/assets/solarflux/sp_de.chaotic.png\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" />&nbsp;混沌太陽能面板</p>\n<ul>\n<li>生成：524,288 FE/每秒</li>\n<li>傳輸：4,096,000 FE/每秒</li>\n<li>容量：2,048,000,000 FE</li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/projects/261061\"><img src=\"https://curseforge.zeith.org/api/v2/logo?id=261061\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" /> Black Hole Storage</a> 面板：</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://assets.zeith.org/assets/solarflux/solar_panel_dark_matter.png\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" />&nbsp;物質太陽能面板</p>\n<ul>\n<li>生成：65,536 FE/每秒</li>\n<li>傳輸：512,000 FE/每秒</li>\n<li>容量：256,000,000 FE</li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/projects/223628\"><img src=\"https://curseforge.zeith.org/api/v2/logo?id=223628\" alt=\"\" width=\"49\" height=\"32\" />&nbsp;Thaumcraft</a> 面板：</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://assets.zeith.org/assets/solarflux/solar_panel_alchemical.png\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" />&nbsp;煉金術士太陽能面板</p>\n<ul>\n<li>生成：8 FE/每秒</li>\n<li>傳輸：64 FE/每秒</li>\n<li>容量：125,000 FE</li>\n</ul>\n<p><img src=\"https://assets.zeith.org/assets/solarflux/solar_panel_alchemical_brass.png\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" />&nbsp;黃銅太陽能面板</p>\n<ul>\n<li>生成：32 FE/每秒</li>\n<li>傳輸：256 FE/每秒</li>\n<li>容量：425,000 FE</li>\n</ul>\n<p><img src=\"https://assets.zeith.org/assets/solarflux/solar_flux.png\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" />&nbsp;Thaumium 太陽能面板</p>\n<ul>\n<li>生成：128 FE/每秒</li>\n<li>傳輸：1,024 FE/每秒</li>\n<li>容量：2,000,000 FE</li>\n</ul>\n<p><img src=\"https://assets.zeith.org/assets/solarflux/solar_flux_void_metal.png\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" />&nbsp;虛空金屬太陽能面板</p>\n<ul>\n<li>生成：512 FE/每秒</li>\n<li>傳輸：4,096 FE/每秒</li>\n<li>容量：8,000,000 FE</li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/projects/261348\"><img src=\"https://curseforge.zeith.org/api/v2/logo?id=261348\" alt=\"\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" />&nbsp;Avaritia</a> 面板：</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://assets.zeith.org/assets/solarflux/sp_avaritia.neutronium.png\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" />&nbsp;中子星太陽能面板（若已安裝 Avaritia）</p>\n<ul>\n<li>生成：8,388,608 FE/每秒</li>\n<li>傳輸：32,768,000 FE/每秒</li>\n<li>容量：131,072,000,000 FE</li>\n</ul>\n<p><img src=\"https://assets.zeith.org/assets/solarflux/sp_avaritia.infinity.png\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" />&nbsp;無限太陽能面板（若已安裝 Avaritia）</p>\n<ul>\n<li>生成：16,777,216 FE/每秒</li>\n<li>傳輸：65,536,000 FE/每秒</li>\n<li>容量：262,144,000,000 FE</li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/projects/227639\"><img src=\"https://curseforge.zeith.org/api/v2/logo?id=227639\" alt=\"\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" />&nbsp;The Twilight Forest</a> 面板：</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://assets.zeith.org/assets/solarflux/sp_tf.fiery.png\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" /> 熾熱太陽能面板（若已安裝 The Twilight Forest）</p>\n<ul>\n<li>生成：2,048 FE/每秒</li>\n<li>傳輸：16,384 FE/每秒</li>\n<li>容量：32,000,000 FE</li>\n</ul>\n<p><img src=\"https://assets.zeith.org/assets/solarflux/sp_tf.carminite.png\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" /> 卡拉敏太陽能面板（若已安裝 The Twilight Forest）</p>\n<ul>\n<li>生成：8,192 FE/每秒</li>\n<li>傳輸：65,536 FE/每秒</li>\n<li>容量：64,000,000 FE</li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><strong>物品：</strong></span></p>\n<p>材料：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><img src=\"https://assets.zeith.org/assets/solarflux/mirror.png\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" />&nbsp;鏡面</li>\n<li><img src=\"https://assets.zeith.org/assets/solarflux/photovoltaic_cell_1.png\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" />&nbsp;光伏電池 I</li>\n<li><img src=\"https://assets.zeith.org/assets/solarflux/photovoltaic_cell_2.png\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" /> 光伏電池 II</li>\n<li><img src=\"https://assets.zeith.org/assets/solarflux/photovoltaic_cell_3.png\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" /> 光伏電池 III</li>\n<li><img src=\"https://assets.zeith.org/assets/solarflux/photovoltaic_cell_4.png\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" /> 光伏電池 IV</li>\n<li><img src=\"https://assets.zeith.org/assets/solarflux/photovoltaic_cell_5.png\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" /> 光伏電池 V</li>\n<li><img src=\"https://assets.zeith.org/assets/solarflux/photovoltaic_cell_6.png\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" /> 光伏電池 VI</li>\n<li><img src=\"https://assets.zeith.org/assets/solarflux/blazing_coating.png\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" /> 烈焰塗層</li>\n<li><img src=\"https://assets.zeith.org/assets/solarflux/emerald_glass.png\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" /> 翡翠玻璃</li>\n<li><img src=\"https://assets.zeith.org/assets/solarflux/ender_glass.png\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" /> 終界玻璃</li>\n<li><img src=\"https://assets.zeith.org/assets/solarflux/photovoltaic_cell_dark_matter.png\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" />&nbsp;黑暗物質光伏電池&nbsp;(若已安裝<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/projects/261061\"><img src=\"https://curseforge.zeith.org/api/v2/logo?id=261061\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" /> Black Hole Storage</a>)</li>\n<li><img src=\"https://assets.zeith.org/assets/solarflux/twilightforest_twilight_cell_1.png\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" /> 暮光電池 I (若<a href=\"https://curseforge.com/projects/227639\"><img src=\"https://curseforge.zeith.org/api/v2/logo?id=227639\" alt=\"\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" />&nbsp;The Twilight Forest</a> 已安裝)</li>\n<li><img src=\"https://assets.zeith.org/assets/solarflux/twilightforest_twilight_cell_2.png\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" /> 暮光電池 II (若<a href=\"https://curseforge.com/projects/227639\"><img src=\"https://curseforge.zeith.org/api/v2/logo?id=227639\" alt=\"\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" />&nbsp;The Twilight Forest</a> 已安裝)</li>\n<li><img src=\"https://assets.zeith.org/assets/solarflux/blank_upgrade.png\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" />&nbsp;空白升級包</li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>升級包：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><img src=\"https://assets.zeith.org/assets/solarflux/efficiency_upgrade.png\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" />&nbsp;效率升級（最高 20，20 = 生成 ×2）</li>\n<li><img src=\"https://assets.zeith.org/assets/solarflux/transfer_rate_upgrade.png\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" />&nbsp;傳輸率升級（最高 10，10 = 傳輸 ×2.5）</li>\n<li><img src=\"https://assets.zeith.org/assets/solarflux/capacity_upgrade.png\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" />&nbsp;容量升級（最高 10，10 = 容量 ×2）</li>\n<li><img src=\"https://assets.zeith.org/assets/solarflux/traversal_upgrade.png\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" />&nbsp;傳輸升級（安裝後，太陽能面板將向周圍 5 格內的機器輸出能量）</li>\n<li><img src=\"https://assets.zeith.org/assets/solarflux/dispersive_upgrade.png\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" />&nbsp;分散升級（安裝後，太陽能面板將為附近玩家充電）</li>\n<li><img src=\"https://assets.zeith.org/assets/solarflux/block_charging_upgrade.png\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" />&nbsp;方塊充電升級（安裝前需連結目標方塊；安裝後，太陽能面板將向 16 格內的聯結方塊輸出能量）</li>\n<li><img src=\"https://assets.zeith.org/assets/solarflux/furnace_upgrade.png\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" />&nbsp;熔爐升級（安裝後，將自動填充下方熔爐燃料）</li>\n<li><img src=\"https://assets.zeith.org/assets/solarflux/twilightforest_twilight_upgrade.png\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" />&nbsp;暮光升級&nbsp;(若已安裝<a href=\"https://curseforge.com/projects/227639\"><img src=\"https://curseforge.zeith.org/api/v2/logo?id=227639\" alt=\"\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" />&nbsp;The Twilight Forest</a>)（略微提升暮光森林中太陽能面板的採光量）</li>\n<li><img src=\"https://assets.zeith.org/assets/solarflux/ae2_energy_upgrade.png\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" />&nbsp;AEU 能源升級(若已安裝<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/ae2\"><img src=\"https://curseforge.zeith.org/api/v2/logo?id=223794\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" /> Applied Energistics 2</a>)（可直接將太陽能面板連接至 ME 網絡）</li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h4><strong>部分功能：</strong></h4>\n<ul>\n<li>等級數量及其生產/容量可完全自訂以符合需求。</li>\n<li>相鄰的太陽能面板會自動分享能量，無需電線。</li>\n<li>所有配方皆僅基於原作者 <a href=\"http://minecraft.curseforge.com/members/_ForgeUser14240544\"><img src=\"http://dccg.herokuapp.com/cfmember/_ForgeUser14240544/avatar\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" />&nbsp;<strong>Nauktis</strong> 的原生 Vanilla 配方。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h5><del>此模組包含 3 種電線：</del> (自 4.xxx 版本移除，不會在 SFR 中復原)</h5>\n<ul>\n<li><del><strong>基礎版</strong> - 每秒 320 RF</del></li>\n<li><del><strong>進階版</strong> - 每秒 3,200 RF</del></li>\n<li><del><strong>最後版</strong> - 每秒 320,000 RF</del></li>\n<li><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>現移至 <a href=\"https://minecraft.curseforge.com/projects/303824\"><img src=\"https://curseforge.zeith.org/api/v2/logo?id=303824\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" />Cable Flux</a></strong></span><strong>。</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>SolarFluxReborn 是一個模組極簡但同時卻極具模塊化的模组！</p>\n<p>我們增強 Solar Flux Reborn 的能力：加入 API。因此，新增元件成為可能。</p>\n<p>已知且出色的元件列表：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://minecraft.curseforge.com/projects/294624\"><img src=\"https://curseforge.zeith.org/api/v2/logo?id=294624\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" />&nbsp;<strong>可穿戴太陽能板</strong></a>&nbsp;- 允許將任何太陽能板安裝在任何頭盔物品上。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h5 id=\"title-3\">特別感謝：</h5>\n<ul>\n<li><strong><a href=\"https://minecraft.curseforge.com/members/Ircmaan\"><img src=\"http://dccg.herokuapp.com/cfmember/Ircmaan/avatar/40\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" />&nbsp;Ircmaan</a>&nbsp;</strong>貢獻點子與靈感。</li>\n<li><a href=\"http://minecraft.curseforge.com/members/_ForgeUser14240544\"><img src=\"http://dccg.herokuapp.com/cfmember/_ForgeUser14240544/avatar/40\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" />&nbsp;<strong>Nauktis</strong></a>&nbsp;創建了原版 <a href=\"http://minecraft.curseforge.com/projects/223548\"><img src=\"https://curseforge.zeith.org/api/v2/logo?id=223548\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" />&nbsp;<strong>Solar Flux</strong></a>（針對 1.7.10 版本）。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong><img style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/LuJJMv1.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"698\" height=\"1\" /></strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>許可權：</strong></p>\n<ul style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<li style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>您可以在您的整合包中使用此模組。</strong></li>\n<li style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"color: #993300;\"><strong>未經 Modrinth/CurseForge 下載連結或本人同意（致信<a href=\"https://me.zeith.org\"><span style=\"color: #00ffff;\"><img src=\"https://assets.zeith.org/icons/zeitheron.png\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\">&nbsp;Zeitheron</span></a>或通過 Discord），不得將此模組重新發佈至其他網站。</strong></span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>禁止將此模組（或 DragonForge 團隊的任何其他模組）納入您自己的整合包中。然而，開發附加元件是被允許的，但建議以友善的方式通知。</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>註：</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>本模組僅支援最新 Minecraft 版本。請勿詢問降級事宜！</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><a class=\"js-qwynlraxz\" href=\"https://ds.zeith.org/dev\"><img src=\"https://ds.zeith.org/cards/dev.png\" width=\"510\" height=\"170\" /></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>有任何問題？需要協助使用 API？</strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>加入 <a href=\"http://bit.ly/ZeithTwitter\"><img src=\"https://abs.twimg.com/favicons/twitter.ico\" alt=\"\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" />Discord 伺服器</strong>&nbsp;並關注 Zeitheron 的 <a href=\"http://bit.ly/ZeithTwitter\"><img src=\"https://abs.twimg.com/favicons/twitter.ico\" alt=\"\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" />Twitter</a>！</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>如需支持我的作品，可透過 <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/zeitheron\"><img src=\"https://c5.patreon.com/external/favicon/favicon-32x32.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" />&nbsp;Patreon</a>成為贊助者。&nbsp;<img src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/pix.iemoji.com/twit33/0744.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"33\" height=\"33\" /></strong></p>",
